<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισφίγγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bind tight, tighten,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κημούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.698
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρθηκας</span> (splints) <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).398
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδιλα ἐ. τοὺς πόδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Am.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τινὰ πήχεσι</span> in the
			arms, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.242
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Maced.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοὺς ἀναγωγέας</span>
			<i>tie</i> the shoe-strings <i>tight,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				12.543f
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοσχεύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					10.12.3
				</span></i>
			: metaph.,<i>shut up tightly,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θησαυροὺς</span>] 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.108
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν ἀμφισβήτησιν</span>
			<i>complicate</i> it, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύειν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				2.96
			</span></i> ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν νήτην</span>
			<i>screw</i> it <i>tighter, tune</i> the instrument, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				9.36
			</span></i> : metaph., <i>'screw up', intensify,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδύνας</span> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠδίνας</span> cod.) <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.680
			</span></i>.</div>
